{"id":"1d4d80c0749de39d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Supermartingale","display":"df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale — ZFC Prob2 Supermartingale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale","58-df-zfc-prob3-supermartingale"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale — ZFC Prob2 Supermartingale","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale</span><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-supermartingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-supermartingale — ZFC Prob2 Supermartingale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span> are the canonical probability predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> are the canonical set-theoretic predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}supermartingale} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(I)\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\in j\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(j))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land X_\\bullet(i)\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P))\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\in j\\to\\exists Y\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb P)\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X_\\bullet(j),\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:Y(\\xi)\\leq X_\\bullet(i)(\\xi)\\})=1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}supermartingale} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(I)\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\in j\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(j))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X_\\bullet,I,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X_\\bullet(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land X_\\bullet(i)\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P))\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\in j\\to\\exists Y\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb P)\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X_\\bullet(j),\\mathcal F_\\bullet(i),\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:Y(\\xi)\\leq X_\\bullet(i)(\\xi)\\})=1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}supermartingale\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}supermartingale\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Integrability, the ordinal-indexed filtration, adapted real random variables, conditional-expectation witnesses, and the almost-sure inequality are explicit.</li>\n<li>The prob3 name is an exact alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Supermartingale}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Zfc